WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.324
Dad: Did you have fun fishing, Sam?

2
00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:09.333
Sam: Yes! I can't wait to show Mom my fish.

3
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:10.675
Lucky: Woof!

4
00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:20.553
Sam: Okay, Lucky. I'll tell her about the crab too!

5
00:00:20.554 --> 00:00:23.208
Dad: We'd better get going, Sam.

6
00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:25.479
Sam: Is there a storm coming?

7
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:33.130
Dad: I think so. We have to hurry.

8
00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:36.606
Sam: Boats aren't safe in a storm, Lucky.

9
00:00:36.607 --> 00:00:49.848
But don't worry. We'll be home soon. Dad:

10
00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.809
Uh-oh. Sam:

11
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.566
What's wrong, Dad? Dad:

12
00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.980
We ran out of gas!

13
00:00:55.981 --> 00:01:02.613
Sam: Oh no . . . It's getting dark. And windy!

14
00:01:02.614 --> 00:01:06.170
Dad: Let's blow the air horn. It's loud.

15
00:01:06.171 --> 00:01:08.318
People will hear it and come to help. Sam:

16
00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:10.080
There's a boat! Dad:

17
00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:12.070
I'll get the horn. Oh

18
00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:16.705
no! I can't find the horn! Lucky: Woof!

19
00:01:16.706 --> 00:01:21.191
Woof! Woof! Woof!

20
00:01:21.192 --> 00:01:25.074
Sam: Help!

21
00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:29.465
Dad: They're coming! Good job, Lucky!

22
00:01:29.466 --> 00:01:33.384
Sam: Good dog!

23
00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:36.404
Dad: That was a close one, Sam.

24
00:01:36.405 --> 00:01:43.724
Sam: Lucky, you saved the day. You're a hero!

